            { "text": "Recall は、画面のスナップショットをローカルに保存して検索できる Copilot+ PC の機能", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/purview/dlp-recall-get-started", "locator": "概要", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T08:05:00Z" }] },
